{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1314318-exiled-from-existence-the-retconian","id":1314318,"title":"Exiled from Existence: The Retconian","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-05-25T10:21:30-07:00","id":1314318,"title":"Exiled from Existence: The Retconian","content":"There is a prison greater even than Malfeas reserved for the greatest criminals of the world. Once an individual is consigned to its depths their existence in the world as they knew it is completely erased, it's as though they never existed. Some say that there is a window allowing these unknown and unknowable entities to gaze out at the world that exists obliviously without them longing for release or a death that will never come... <br /> <br /> This forbidden text, believed to be produced by the prison's wardens the Redactors is all that documents these damned inmates and suggests reasons for their punishment.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Desus</b><br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/pFxgW.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> Desus never thought of himself as a villain, but no seperation existed between the life he lived and the abuse he carried out upon his wife and Lunar Mate Lilith behind closed doors. He was introduced first and foremost as a bully and abuser with the fanbase charged with the task of inventing heroic tasks that he could be held in high regard for. They didn't, instead Desus' abuses became a meme until he transitioned from flawed hero to probable living identity for The Silver Prince.<br /> The idea that Lilith was better off without him left Desus sick to his stomach, he watched her romance with the pretender Andamani play out being delighted by his death. He still watches his former mate on nights of the Full Moon vowing to find his way back to her somehow. <br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Tachi-Kun</b><br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://i.pinimg.com/originals/0b/f8/0d/0bf80d506b1f8d2136f529e98cebb9ab.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> The former God of Exalted Warfare wonders what he did to deserve this fate, he blames two factors.<br /> The First is the Bronze Faction for his disdain towards the Dragon-Blooded. Though privately he considers that his lack of development, his ill defined rivalry with Voharun and how his purview of Exalted Warfare seemed to translate to rolling more dice and turning into a dragon for... reasons. He was also cursed with a name that is Japanese for &quot;Sword Friend&quot; which led to the Redactors to replace him. It's perhaps telling that Tachi-Kun pays little heed to the world he was once part of.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-25T10:30:36-07:00","id":1314321,"title":"","content":"Can't say I was a fan of Desus, but 3e Lilith seems so...boring and indecisive now. She went from having a justifiably wary view of the returning Solars and intentions to police their abuses to pining over a dead guy for centuries. Before she was &quot;Dangerous Action Mentor&quot; that warned Swan of the dangers of hubris.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24948-hamsandlich","name":"HamSandLich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24948_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"161"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-25T10:46:22-07:00","id":1314323,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HamSandLich</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1314318-exiled-from-existence-the-retconian?p=1314321#post1314321\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can't say I was a fan of Desus, but 3e Lilith seems so...boring and indecisive now. She went from having a justifiably wary view of the returning Solars and intentions to police their abuses to pining over a dead guy for centuries. Before she was &quot;Dangerous Action Mentor&quot; that warned Swan of the dangers of hubris.</div> </div> </div> </div>Lilith has never felt like a full character to me.<br /> Mostly because Swan was the Eclipse signature character, if he was an example of who your guy could be she was an example of what your guy's First Age baggage might entail. Most people I 've met over the years who were inspired by Lilith just made their own character and even the abusive aspect of it became normalised.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-25T10:57:28-07:00","id":1314324,"title":"","content":"My biggest problem with 3e Lilith is that the default inspiration character from her is going to be &quot;hey new solar, want a girlfriend?&quot; as opposed to &quot;here's your estranged wife from centuries ago, if you fuck up and be less than the hero you say you are, she'll rip out your heart and eat it&quot;. Sure, neither is a full character, but one has agency and an agenda and the other has defined her existence around a relationship that doesn't really exist anymore. She's a Lunar, from whence comes this stagnation?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24948-hamsandlich","name":"HamSandLich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24948_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"161"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-25T14:46:53-07:00","id":1314377,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HamSandLich</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1314318-exiled-from-existence-the-retconian?p=1314324#post1314324\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My biggest problem with 3e Lilith is that the default inspiration character from her is going to be &quot;hey new solar, want a girlfriend?&quot; as opposed to &quot;here's your estranged wife from centuries ago, if you fuck up and be less than the hero you say you are, she'll rip out your heart and eat it&quot;. Sure, neither is a full character, but one has agency and an agenda and the other has defined her existence around a relationship that doesn't really exist anymore. She's a Lunar, from whence comes this stagnation?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Which is why her Intimacy towards Andamani's reincarnation is &quot;Ambivalent.&quot;<br /> <br /> Wait, no, that's the exact opposite of stagnation and a pretty understandable reaction to realizing you've spent literal centuries in a fugue over a personal tragedy.<br /> <br /> And really, I can't say I dislike Lilith the PTSD Owl at all; she's damaged, but she's damaged in a way that is pretty realistic. I get the sense she has some codependency issues and Andamani's death was simply the inciting incident in a long spiral of tragedies caused by the Usurpation. And, more importantly, she's trying to come back to a <i>healthy </i>relationship, as opposed to something she remembers as a cycle of abuse, and is portrayed as being on the mend instead of barely holding together.<br /> <br /> Kind of a step up, and has a lot more agency, if you ask me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-25T16:01:35-07:00","id":1314389,"title":"","content":"2e-