,"id":1314704,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maseiken</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1314318-exiled-from-existence-the-retconian?p=1314693#post1314693\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No they mean Lilun.</div> </div> </div> </div>Do they?<br /> <br /> @Sith Happens: Please tell us who you mean.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-27T09:26:34-07:00","id":1314716,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HamSandLich</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1314318-exiled-from-existence-the-retconian?p=1314549#post1314549\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On a more sombre note, the Sun's long neglected former-friend/family member posse of Nysela, Little Beam, and Bannery Bu are kaput</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Robert Vance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1314318-exiled-from-existence-the-retconian?p=1314561#post1314561\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't believe we've said that.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm confident that I have a copy of my Song of Baneri-Bu tucked away somewhere, and failing that, I would be able to recreate it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-27T10:41:01-07:00","id":1314735,"title":"","content":"I liked Desus actually. I always envisioned him as an abusive solar in the thrall of the Great Curse,no doubt previously heroic or even heroic at time while abusive. After all, there had to be good reasons for the Dragon blooded to rise up in the usurpation. Desus gave us a nice example of a solar that, in some ways, justified the usurpation. Anyway, I think we do need examples of mad Solars. But maybe I misunderstood you, Lioness?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24253-magnus-k","name":"Magnus K","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-27T10:48:30-07:00","id":1314737,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maseiken</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1314318-exiled-from-existence-the-retconian?p=1314693#post1314693\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">No they mean Lilun.</div> </div> </div> </div>Unlike Havesh, who I imagine will just never be mentioned, Lilun is someone who I could imagine might get retconned with a quick mention somewhere, like &quot;the Empress's daughter Lilun lives with her sister V'neef&quot; or something. Just to make it clear that she's no longer... that. The way Desus has actually been retconned out of existence.<br /> <br /> But the best place to do that would be in the Realm, and she's not mentioned (unlike several of the Empress's other young children), so I'm guessing we'll just never see her mentioned again.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-27T11:50:07-07:00","id":1314744,"title":"","content":"The funny thing is, with a new type of Exalted who are literally defined by having had their existence retconned, any mortal NPC who seems to have become irrelevant in 3E might actually have become a Getimian <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","name":"Epitome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-27T12:12:20-07:00","id":1314749,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnus K</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1314318-exiled-from-existence-the-retconian?p=1314735#post1314735\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I liked Desus actually. I always envisioned him as an abusive solar in the thrall of the Great Curse,no doubt previously heroic or even heroic at time while abusive.</div> </div> </div> </div> Envisioned is a key word here. You were largely required to make up his heroic feats on your own.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnus K</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">After all, there had to be good reasons for the Dragon blooded to rise up in the usurpation.Desus gave us a nice example of a solar that, in some ways, justified the usurpation. Anyway, I think we do need examples of mad Solars.</div> </div> </div> </div> Much with the heroic feats its unclear what the Dragon-Blooded's problem with him was. I'm pretty sure it wasn't his abuse of Lilith though.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-27T12:37:39-07:00","id":1314762,"title":"","content":"That is fair, I just envisioned that with his madness there was far more than the abuse of Lillith at hand, but yes, I do get your point. I just guess I just envisioned him a mad solar and therefore some what liked him as an example of a cruel mad solar. But yeah, maybe you are right.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24253-magnus-k","name":"Magnus K","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-27T12:45:43-07:00","id":1314767,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1314318-exiled-from-existence-the-retconian?p=1314737#post1314737\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Unlike Havesh, who I imagine will just never be mentioned, Lilun is someone who I could imagine might get retconned with a quick mention somewhere, like &amp;quot;the Empress's daughter Lilun lives with her sister V'neef&amp;quot; or something. Just to make it clear that she's no longer... that. The way Desus has actually been retconned out of existence.<br /> <br /> But the best place to do that would be in the Realm, and she's not mentioned (unlike several of the Empress's other young children), so I'm guessing we'll just never see her mentioned again.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well if 1e is still considered a reasonable source we have to assume that Lilun disappeared into the Imperial Manse after Mnemon tried to use her to see what was going on in there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","name":"Hark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar151_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"932"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-27T14:31:41-07:00","id":1314798,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HamSandLich</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1314318-exiled-from-existence-the-retconian?p=1314321#post1314321\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Can't say I was a fan of Desus, but 3e Lilith seems so...boring and indecisive now. She went from having a justifiably wary view of the returning Solars and intentions to police their abuses to pining over a dead guy for centuries. Before she was &quot;Dangerous Action Mentor&quot; that warned Swan of the dangers of hubris.</div> </div> </div> </div>Who the fuck cares about Swan? I want npcs that are relevant for my player characters.<br /> <br /> She\u2019s only \u201cindecisive\u201d because the pc who is the reincarnation of her spouse hasn\u2019t acted yet for her to react against and form an opinion. She absolutely still has the \u201cwill rip your heart out and eat it in front of you as the life goes out of your eyes\u201d potential if your pc disappoints her.<br /> <br /> <br /> I strongly recommend reading Lilith\u2019s 1E material from before one of the setting\u2019s most iconic Lunar was crammed into a parable about how big douches First Age Solars were as her primary narrative function.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 02-11-2020, 12:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-27T14:45:05-07:00","id":1314801,"title":"","content":"I hope Queen K'Tula's not in there<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"