1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-27T18:41:07-07:00","id":1314858,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1314318-exiled-from-existence-the-retconian?p=1314798#post1314798\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Who the fuck cares about Swan? I want npcs that are relevant for my player characters.<br /> <br /> She\u2019s only \u201cindecisive\u201d because the pc who is the reincarnation of her spouse hasn\u2019t acted yet for her to react against and form an opinion. She absolutely still has the \u201cwill tip your heart out and eat it in front of you as the life goes out of your eyes\u201d potential if your pc disappoints her.<br /> <br /> <br /> I strongly recommend reading Likith\u2019s 1E material from before one of the setting\u2019s most iconic Lunars was crammed into a parable about how big douches First Age Solars were as her primary narrative function.</div> </div> </div> </div>Mainly because he was the most grounded and down to earth signature solar for 1e-2e. Panther spent too much time punching rather than saving, Dace was a mercenary, Jade has bad habits from her time in the Salmalin, and Arianna is three different kinds of jerkass. Of them all, he was the most likely to want to do something heroic (other than violence), to question the assumption that Solars are inherently righteous, and the most likely to recommend a peaceful course of action. Which is all kinds of surprising given that he grew up in Coral.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24948-hamsandlich","name":"HamSandLich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24948_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"161"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-27T23:44:37-07:00","id":1314893,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HamSandLich</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1314318-exiled-from-existence-the-retconian?p=1314858#post1314858\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...to question the assumption that Solars are inherently righteous,...</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm sorry, but I find myself confused on this statement? Isn't the common assumption about Solars in creation that they're 1)Literal Sun stealing demon sorcerers. or if more educated 2) Exalted that eventually turn bat shit insane, destroying everything around them, and being generally super god damn evil? <br /> <br /> Where an assumption like that one is even coming from? Other then perhaps the Sun for Zeniths.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14713-chronos12","name":"Chronos12","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14713_2.png","title":"Memb